## 定理 524.1（Moment affine budget law）

$$
\boxed{
\widehat m_{n,L}^{(a)}(R)
=
A_{n,L}^{(a)}
+
B_{n,L}^{(a)}R,
}
\tag{524.4}
$$

其中：

$$
\boxed{
A_{n,L}^{(a)}
=
-\int_0^{2L}
K_{n,a}(t)H_{L,0}(t)\,dt,
}
\tag{524.5}
$$

$$
\boxed{
B_{n,L}^{(a)}
=
1-
\int_0^{2L}
K_{n,a}(t)\cosh(at)\,dt.
}
\tag{524.6}
$$

